    slug: "how-to-check-iphone-battery-health",
    title: "How to Check Your iPhone's Battery Health",
    category: "phones",
    excerpt: "Find out how worn down your iPhone battery is and when it may be time to get a replacement — in just a few taps.",
    thumbnailEmoji: "🔋",
